<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Data started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Data started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of National Data Corp as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $55 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects National Data to earn $1.38 a share in 1997 and $1.77 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- National Data gained 1/4 to 40-1/4.</p>
</text>
